### Health check
# @name health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Log in and capture the token
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Reuse the token from the login response
# @name profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Accept: application/json
